			"notes": "## SAH TTF Sign Fix 1.0.0\n\nInitial release.\n\n### Fixes\n\n* Restores TTF font rendering on signs when using Iris shaders.\n* Fixes missing sign text in Minecraft 26.2.\n* Fixes grayscale TTF rendering issues introduced with the Minecraft 26.3 rendering backend changes.\n\n### Compatibility\n\n* Minecraft 26.2–26.3\n* Fabric\n* Iris 1.11.2+\n* Java 25\n* Client-side only\n\nTested with BSL Shaders and Complementary Unbound."
